      "sourceText": "- `串口打开失败`：检查设备名、USB-TTL 是否插好、当前用户是否有串口权限。\n- 已打开串口但没有协议回调：检查 TX/RX 是否交叉、是否共地、两端波特率是否一致，以及命令号和字段类型是否对应。\n- `set_unpack_callback()` 返回 `false`：检查命令是否重复、是否超过 8 个回调，或是否传入空函数。",
      "translatedText": "- `串口打开失败`: Check the device name and whether USB-TTL is properly connected, and whether the current user has serial port permissions\\.\n- Serial port opened but no protocol callback: Check whether TX/RX is crossed, whether they share a common ground, whether the baud rates at both ends match, and whether the command numbers and field types correspond\\.\n- `set_unpack_callback()` Return `false`: Check whether the command is duplicated, whether it exceeds 8 callbacks, or whether a null function was passed\\.",
